/ActualText (Lagroce Retail operates as an ONDC Seller Network Participant in the marketplace model, serving as a crucial link between sellers and ONDC. Their comprehensive software solution facilitates seamless connectivity to ONDC, streamlining the entire spectrum of business operations, from offline store management to online activities, including integrated e-commerce systems. Lagroce boasts a robust technology infrastructure suitable for various retail businesses, aiming to alleviate.)
