/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 118 0 R
/ActualText (ONDC, a central government initiative for e-commerce, serves as a platform akin to UPI for seamless connectivity among buyers, sellers, and delivery agents. It fosters equal trade opportunities for small and medium enterprises, charging only nominal fees for its Seller App, Buyer Apps, and logistics, without taking commissions. Spearheaded by Nandan Nilekani and a team of high-caliber intellectuals with broad support, ONDC promotes inclusivity, discoverability, and interoperability. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
