/S /P
/P 118 0 R
/ActualText (Banks, financial institutions, and government bodies are actively investing in ONDC for promotions, discounts, and offers. The platform is designed to empower offline retailers, enabling them to establish an online presence and customer base at a low cost, free from reliance on third-party companies. Awareness programs by various government entities further highlight the initiative's significance.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
